OL,3,GNEWSAMan who groomed and blackmailed
OL,4,Agirls online sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who groomed and blackmailed four
OL,7,Fteenage girls into sharing indecent
OL,8,Fimages of themselves has been
OL,9,Fsentenced.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said Ben Dodd,
OL,12,F20, targeted the girls, aged 14 to 17
OL,13,Fyears old, through social media and
OL,14,Fencouraged them to send him images and
OL,15,Fvideos of a sexual nature.
OL,17,FHe then blackmailed them into sending
OL,18,Fhim more material by threatening to
OL,19,Fshare the content with their friends
OL,20,Fand family, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
