OL,3,GNEWSAMan who groomed and blackmailed
OL,4,Agirls online sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, Dodd, from Leicester, was
OL,7,Fgiven a two-year prison sentence -
OL,8,Fsuspended for two years - after
OL,9,Fpleading guilty to 15 offences in
OL,10,FMarch.
